196-We show this in Proposition <a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2509.21286v1#S7.Thmtheorem5" title="Proposition 7.5. ‣ 7 Cubical structures in generic networks ‣ Maxout Polytopes"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7.5</span></a> and Figure <a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2509.21286v1#S7.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ 7 Cubical structures in generic networks ‣ Maxout Polytopes"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a>.</p>
