404-However, the formula (<a class="ltx_ref" href="https://arxiv.org/html/2509.21286v1#S2.E6" title="In 2 From Networks to Polytopes ‣ Maxout Polytopes"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a>) defines a
