213:<p class="ltx_p">Each function <math alttext="f_{i}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S2.p1.m4" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">f_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> is the composition of a linear map followed by a non-linear coordinatewise <em class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">activation function</em>.
