1832:<p class="ltx_p"><span class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">The maxout polytope is cubical if all network parameters are non-zero, and for every word <math alttext="\sigma" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.Thmtheorem3.p1.m1" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math> and any <math alttext="d" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.Thmtheorem3.p1.m2" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>d</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">d</annotation></semantics></math> words <math alttext="\tau_{1},\ldots,\tau_{d}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.Thmtheorem3.p1.m3" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tau_{1},\ldots,\tau_{d}</annotation></semantics></math> adjacent to <math alttext="\sigma" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.Thmtheorem3.p1.m4" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>σ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma</annotation></semantics></math>, <math alttext="V^{\sigma}\!-V^{\tau_{1}},\ldots,V^{\sigma}\!-V^{\tau_{d}}" class="ltx_Math" display="inline" id="S7.Thmtheorem3.p1.m5" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>σ</mi></msup><mo lspace="0.052em">−</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>τ</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></msup></mrow><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><msup><mi>V</mi><mi>σ</mi></msup><mo>−</mo><msup><mi>V</mi><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>d</mi></msub></msup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">V^{\sigma}\!-V^{\tau_{1}},\ldots,V^{\sigma}\!-V^{\tau_{d}}</annotation></semantics></math> are independent.</span></p>
